        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide developers with a suite of analytics tools that help them independently monitor and diagnose quality concerns, identify root causes and address issues related to our products to improve end user experience.",
