        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We take pride in having a developer-centric business model and have cultivated a large and engaged developer community with more than one million accumulated registered applications as of December 31, 2025.",
        "start_character": 15152,
        "end_character": 15358
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-155920",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-155920-3ab1089dab5fae1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-155920",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We want to empower every developer, whether working as a solo entrepreneur or as part of a larger organization, to leverage reliable, low-latency, customizable real-time engagement service to create innovative products, elevate end user experience and differentiate themselves from their competitors, without the burden of developing the technology or building the underlying infrastructure themselves.",
        "start_character": 14499,
        "end_character": 14901
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-155920",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-155920-3ab1089dab5fae1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-155920",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we had 350 employees in our global research and development team with extensive knowledge and experience in RTE technologies, representing 64.5% of our total employees.",
        "start_character": 45052,
        "end_character": 45245
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-155920",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-155920-3ab1089dab5fae1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-155920",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As usage exceeds the allotted free minutes, we charge developers based on usage and they become our customers.",
        "start_character": 16743,
        "end_character": 16853
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-155920",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-155920-3ab1089dab5fae1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-155920",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In March 2025, we launched our conversational AI engine, empowering developers to build voice AI agents that converse with humans naturally.",
        "start_character": 15782,
        "end_character": 15922
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-155920",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-155920-3ab1089dab5fae1d",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-155920",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, the application and interpretation of these laws and regulations often are uncertain, particularly in the new and rapidly evolving industry in which we operate.",
