        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In many cases, we also encounter either custom software developed in-house or by consultants, or legacy solutions repurposed by in-house developers of our potential customers to meet specific use cases.",
